namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Port::getClipRect()
\brief Return the current clipping rectangle in Port coordinates.

Defaults to getDrawingArea(). An empty rectangle means all drawing is clipped.
The returned value is a copy; use setClipRect() to change the clip.
\return The current rectangle, intersected with the drawing area.
\see setClipRect(), resetClipRect()
**/ }
